  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A pair of dice is thrown <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> times. For each throw, a total of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> is considered a success. If the probability of at least&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;successes is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>11</mn></msup></mfrac></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to</p>"
  },
